# UI audit artifacts (regenerable via scripts/ui_audit.py et al.)
# — EXCEPT the visual-regression baselines, which are committed: they are
#   the reference the CI comparison runs against (deterministic: seeded
#   data + fixed viewport + reduced motion).
ui_audit/*
!ui_audit/baselines/
!ui_audit/baselines/*.png
# UI e2e throwaway artifacts (per-session server roots)
ui_e2e_artifacts_*/
ui_e2e_*.db
# UI maturity scan artifacts (regenerable via scripts/ui_maturity_scan.py)
ui_maturity/
.pw-browsers/
# TLS material (self-signed demo certs are generated locally; real certs
# must never be committed)
infrastructure/nginx/certs/
*.key
*.crt
infrastructure/compose/demo.env
.buildx/
roadmap/
